# #152 drills and multi-hit aerials: Warden's up air (3 kicks) and Falling Knives. Warden a against Warden b; syntax and checks: smashcraft:docs/native-bot-session.md.
#! chat -dev quick hero warden
# Both dash in, close.
40 b stick -1 0
42 b stick 0 0
50 a stick 1 0
52 a stick 0 0
# Up air under b, which jumped first.
94 b tap B 8
100 a tap B 8
101 a stick 0.6 0
113 a cstick 0 1
113 a stick 0 0
117 a cstick 0 0
# Frames saved on hits (native only; illustration for the look box).
117 a capture
127 a capture
# Falling Knives on a standing b, just ahead of a.
200 a tap B 8
201 a stick -0.3 0
213 a cstick 0 -1
213 a stick 0 0
217 a cstick 0 0
# Frames saved on hits (native only; illustration for the look box).
219 a capture
231 a capture
# Expected, frame by frame (headless run of this script): the aerial starts, then every hit.
#! expect a 113 applied attack 1 style 15
#! expect a 213 applied attack 2 style 16
#! expect b 117 damage 2.000
#! expect b 122 damage 4.000
#! expect b 127 damage 9.000
#! expect b 219 damage 11.000
#! expect b 223 damage 13.000
#! expect b 227 damage 15.000
#! expect b 231 damage 18.000
#! scene a FanOfKnivesMissile
#! scene a CleaveDamageTarget
# View held a second, twice: the moments the parity check replays.
500 a press VIEW
570 a release VIEW
1000 a press VIEW
1070 a release VIEW
